  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p>부산 지역의&nbsp;중학교 1학년&nbsp;영재학급 수업 시 사용했습니다.</p><p>찾아본 영상들은 굉장히 많으나.. 다 너무 심각한 영상들이네요.</p><p>이 영상을 보여주고&nbsp;<span style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; font-size: 9pt;\">화석 연료의 고갈, 환경 오염 문제들을 이야기 해보았습니다.</span></p></div><p>기회가 된다면 다음번에 신재생에너지 실험 내용도 공유하겠습니다~</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ss5bRyevueA<br></p>\r\n<iframe width=\"420\" height=\"315\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/ss5bRyevueA\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div><br></div><div><div><br></div><div>찾아본 다른 영상입니다~</div><div><br></div><div><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">MBC</span>다큐스페셜<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">- </span>경제성장의 후유증 <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">‘</span>대기오염<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">’</span>화석연료 석탄의 보복<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">! 4</span>분<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">2</span>초</p><p class=\"0\"><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pg4BJaiyJpE\"><u><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;color:#800080;\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pg4BJaiyJpE</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">MBC</span>다큐프라임 <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">- </span>제<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">5</span>에너지 <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">47</span>분<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">41</span>초</p><p class=\"0\"><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zb1Q7t_v-do\"><u><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;color:#0000ff;\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zb1Q7t_v-do</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\">에너지 고갈의 심각성<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">(EBS) - 2</span>분<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">44</span>초</p><p class=\"0\"><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VxIrCgda_50\"><u><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;color:#0000ff;\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VxIrCgda_50</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\">태양에너지의 이용사례<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">(EBS) - 1</span>분<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">21</span>초</p><p class=\"0\"><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mhex1-c0EFs\"><u><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;color:#0000ff;\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mhex1-c0EFs</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\">바람<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">, </span>에너지로 태어나다<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">1(EBS) - 14</span>분<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">49</span>초</p><p class=\"0\"><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkQy_rX4RnY\"><u><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;color:#0000ff;\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkQy_rX4RnY</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">Docuprime_</span>과학대기획<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">_</span>다섯개의 열쇠 <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">5</span>부<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">_</span>태양<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">_#005  (</span>태양에너지를 이용한 사례<span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">) 10</span>분 <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;\">18</span>초</p><p class=\"0\"><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dCuxeFPKfx4\"><u><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;color:#800080;\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dCuxeFPKfx4</span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p></div><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
